# Work on D:

D: is the main working location for these projects. Do not open, edit, run, or build the old C: copies.

- IQ Spectrogram Converter and CRFS IQ Recorder: `D:\IQ Spectogram Converter`
- Recorder downloads: `D:\CRFS IQ Recorder\Recordings`
- Converter WAVs: `D:\IQ Spectogram Converter\IQ Collection`
- Converter PNGs: `D:\IQ Spectogram Converter\IQ Results`

Use those paths in shortcuts, settings, default folders, and build scripts. GitHub remotes stay as they are; D: is a local working copy only.

If a C: project folder reappears, copy any newer files onto D: and keep working on D:. Do not treat C: as the source of truth.
